VISUAL: The reviewer is speaking directly to the camera.
AUDIO: 'continue until every last one of you has hit subscribe. The Alogic Aspect Ultrawide Touch 34 is not a computer. It is a monitor and arm stand system that works with your computer. That\'s one of the major upgrades here. It may seem'

[04:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'like a downgrade, but it\'s not. This fixes one of the Surface Studios biggest flaws. With this, you can upgrade your computer all you want and continue using the display for years and years to come. I bet the vast majority of Surface'

