AUDIO: 'So, let\'s break it down into three chunks. What are the good, the bad, and the ugly? The good, this is a 34in ultrawide display. The design of this thing is really nice. After a week and a half of having this on my desk, I still'

[04:44] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'get a kick out of pulling it down into the drawing position. And in general, the screen size and the ultra wide aspect ratio is good. The color accuracy is pretty good. It\'s got a nice matte coating on it. I like that for drawing,'

