VISUAL: The reviewer is speaking directly to the camera.
AUDIO: 'too. And the stand is really the best part. It It\'s not as smooth and as elegant as the Surface Studio stand, but it it fits the bill. It gets it down to that drawing position without a ton of work. This monitor also has a ton of'

[05:10] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
