[05:22] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'doesn\'t look as good as some of the other displays in this price range or even some of the less expensive like ASUS and BenQ monitors that I\'ve been reviewing this year. This monitor has a 4K width because of its ultra wideness,'

[05:35] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'but only a 1440p depth. That might not be a bad thing for you, but for some of you, it will be. I\'ll go into detail on why in a minute. This is a 100Hz display. Now, that\'s better than just a'

[05:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
